0001                  /* SRAM probe: how much distinct cart SRAM does the emulator actually back?
0002                   * (snespico8 got burned assuming the header request was honored — verify.)
0003                   * HiROM SRAM: banks $20-$3F, window $6000-$7FFF = 8 KB each, 256 KB max.
0004                   * Writes a distinct tag per window, then verifies — mirrors collapse to the
0005                   * last-written tag and fail the check, so n = genuinely distinct windows.
0006                   * Mailbox: MB[0]=0xCAFE done, MB[1]=live windows, MB[2]=KB.
0007                   */
